          <span class="dashboard-tool">Technical SEO</span>
          <span class="dashboard-tool">Content systems</span>
          <span class="dashboard-tool">Automation &amp; AI search</span>
        </div>
        <div class="dashboard-main">
          <div class="dashboard-copy">
            <span class="eyebrow">SEO Strategist <span aria-hidden="true">•</span> Open to opportunities</span>
