          <div class="dashboard-metric"><strong>150+</strong><b>Projects delivered</b><span>Across technical, content, and growth work</span></div>
          <div class="dashboard-metric"><strong>21.2M+</strong><b>Traffic scale</b><span>Search Console clicks on a large site</span></div>
          <div class="dashboard-metric"><strong>6</strong><b>Countries</b><span>Clients and teams supported worldwide</span></div>
